{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SofWZTjBbiYm6G9hVdJ23y","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Brownfield Discovery â€” Execution Log\n2\t\n3\t> Foreman appends per-wave EXECUTE/GATE/REVIEW/JUDGE/FIX verdicts here during the build.\n4\t\n5\t## Wave 1 â€” brownfield_scan.py â€” PASS\n6\t- Implemented `brownfield_scan.py`: bounded walk (depth<=6, files<=5000), skips\n7\t  `.git/node_modules/_archive/.anchor`, classifies by trio provenance signals\n8\t  (foreman checkpoint/config -> build; named planning docs -> planning;\n9\t  report.md/pdf under research/ -> research; deliverables/** -> deliverables;\n10\t  generic *.pdf + root *PLAN*.md -> docs, NOT adopted). Robust to\n11\t  missing/mistyped/UNC path (empty ScanResult, no raise).\n12\t- `tests/test_brownfield_scan.py` (18 tests) green: full ScanResult + exact\n13\t  numeric counts for the planted fixture, parametrized single-file\n14\t  classification, robustness cases, own-`.anchor`-store-not-imported,\n15\t  JSON-serializable `to_dict`.\n16\t\n17\t## Wave 2 â€” effort_history discovery model + reconciliation â€” PASS\n18\t- Added `source=\"discovered\"`, stable path-hash `discovered_job_id`,\n19\t  `adopt_discovered` (idempotent upsert + prune-on-rescan), `reconcile_discovered`\n20\t  (prune-on-deleted-artifact). Discovered records carry real metadata only\n21\t  (rel path, mtime->created_at, title, kind), NO cost/tokens/session_id.\n22\t- `lane_rollup`/`project_rollup` EXCLUDE discovered from effort_count + cost,\n23\t  add parallel `discovered_count` (+ `discovered_cost`=0). `list_efforts` still\n24\t  returns discovered records.\n25\t- `tests/test_brownfield_adopt.py` (6 tests) green: 2 real + 3 discovered ->\n26\t  effort_count==2/discovered_count==3/cost unchanged; idempotent double-adopt;\n27\t  rescan prunes deleted artifact; reconcile never prunes real efforts.\n28\t- LOCKED `tests/test_cost_rollup.py` 3/2/1 effort_count asserts STILL green\n29\t  (seeds no discove